ou almost certainly knew that meeting would never take place, didn&amp;#39;t you? &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;2) When you spray a skunk-like stream of bilious invective at people, you really should have the rudimentary decency to attach your name to your comments. This is especially true of remarks calling into question someone&amp;#39;s competence as a parent, or casting aspersions on her extended family. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You are welcome to publish practically anything in this forum -- apart from demonstrable libel or unfiltered blasphemy -- at such time that you meet the undemanding standard of minimal maturity necessary to do so. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/1843550576160246536'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/1843550576160246536'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1424052686847#c1843550576160246536' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-a8aojUJZY3w/VLgkHDf4rTI/AAAAAAAALNc/ZNKtkMla2UU/s220/Snapshot_20150115_3.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 15, 2015 at 7:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5631408569363501898</id><published>2015-02-10T07:37:52.542-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-10T07:37:52.542-07:00</updated><title type='text'>One more thing, leave innocent children out of you...</title><content type='html'>One more thing, leave innocent children out of your mouths and worry about your own parenting! When you attack a parent by using children, it speaks volumes of your own character! That&amp;#39;s right..this applies to all the internet trolls attacking Sherri in the name of her children! Grow a set because most likely you were born without a uterus to bear children! LEAVE CHILDREN OUT OF YOUR CONVERSATIONS COWARDS!  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/5631408569363501898'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/5631408569363501898'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1423579072542#c5631408569363501898' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1278632525"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 10, 2015 at 7:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7961159735568021081</id><published>2015-02-10T07:04:41.839-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-10T07:04:41.839-07:0