 to them. Maybe you realized that people would know that you were insane after seeing that? 4th please anyone who reads this know she is completing lying, SHE is the stalker. She even created fake FB pages in order to keep stalking after she had moved. You are creating the hostile environment.  The Blacks want nothing to do with you and have tried to avoid you. Please leave this poor family alone. They have more integrity than you will ever have. I have the name of a good psychiatrist if you need a recommendation ;)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/3026787476574995710'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/3026787476574995710'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1423193665655#c3026787476574995710' title=''/><author><name>Amanda A.</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1480207904"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 5, 2015 at 8:34 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-499189975484625616</id><published>2015-01-03T20:36:56.254-07:00</published><updated>2015-01-03T20:36:56.254-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous, I got your message. Thank you.</title><content type='html'>Anonymous, I got your message. Thank you.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/499189975484625616'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/499189975484625616'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1420342616254#c499189975484625616' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-CdehOMAdGmU/U8b9GaqH43I/AAAAAAAAKnc/9NFpgc6WOsk/s220/NewProfile.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 3, 2015 at 8:36 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4665129698290090269</id><published>2015-01-03T19:31:57.955-07:00</published><updated>2015-01-03T19:31:57.955-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous, could you please contact me -- WNGrigg ...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous, could you please contact me -- WNGrigg (at) msn (dot) com?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Will</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/4665129698290090269'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/4665129698290090269'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1420338717955#c4665129698290090269' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-CdehOMAdGmU/U8b9GaqH43I/AAAAAAAAKnc/9NFpgc6WOsk/s220/NewProfile.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 3, 2015 at 7:31 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4071055384222009212</id><published>2015-01-03T19:10:28.952-07:00</published><updated>2015-01-03T19:10:28.952-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Sherri is a strong woman. I didn&amp;#39;t agree with ...</title><content type='html'>Sherri is a strong woman. I didn&amp;#39;t agree with her a first. I actually stood up for Black and others like him. I trusted him. I regret doing so everyday. I reported Black&amp;#39;s behavior and Craig Martinez was the investigating Office that came to interview me. In fact he did twice, making me feel that I was nothing more than a woman wanting revenge. Anyone that knows me knows that I am the last person in the world that needs revenge on anyone. I don&amp;#39;t believe that revenge solves any problem. I fell into the trap of affection and care the Black set up for me. Crossing him have consequences I&amp;#39;m not sure anyone is ready or willing to face. Well, I am still paying for, as he would say, crossing him. I will never trust a law enforcement agent of any kind again. I would rather trust the scum of the earth first. Please be careful what you say on public websites. His team of co-workers will always be watching. Sherri be careful. You are an amazing woman and I don&amp;#39;t want to see you hurt anymore.. Always, YOUR LUNCH DATE. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/4071055384222009212'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/4071055384222009212'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1420337428952#c4071055384222009212' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-933389377"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 3, 2015 at 7:10 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1745471659533473712</id><published>2014-10-12T06:52:47.881-06:00</published><updated>2014-10-12T06:52:47.881-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks Sherri...check your email!:)</title><content type='html'>Thanks Sherri...check your email!:)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/1745471659533473712'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml