schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-583930765"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 11, 2014 at 8:25 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4697502090435361256</id><published>2014-10-11T14:19:47.980-06:00</published><updated>2014-10-11T14:19:47.980-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Sherri...I hope you see my earlier comment. Thanks...</title><content type='html'>Sherri...I hope you see my earlier comment. Thanks to the blogger for posting it. I just read this whole blog and oh my gosh, this is horrible! Please contact the Attorney Generals Office and report this! I am so sorry that you are in fear for your life. I read other posts on the internet and found Thomas&amp;#39;s email, but I want to be sure he still has the same one with @chewy.....If so, just reply yes and I&amp;#39;ll shoot you off an email. Big hugs to you and Thomas. &lt;br /&gt; Your Cousin..Anna</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/4697502090435361256'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/4697502090435361256'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1413058787980#c4697502090435361256' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thu