rl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2009887426"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 11, 2014 at 12:52 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1548464544937908104</id><published>2014-09-11T17:40:17.135-06:00</published><updated>2014-09-11T17:40:17.135-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Sherri - I hope things are going well in your new ...</title><content type='html'>Sherri - I hope things are going well in your new home.  I forgot to look for the pics of the Juab incident I told you about.  I will look for the pics. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;BTW - here is link to my pic of the Santaquin sign like the one above.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://i180.photobucket.com/albums/x281/kuernodechivo/Gunkill.jpg </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/1548464544937908104'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/1548464544937908104'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1410478817135#c1548464544937908104' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://ww