ve:...</title><content type='html'>Another brief note to &amp;quot;Anonymous&amp;quot; above: Yes, I have received your last two submitted comments; no, you will not be permitted to publish any further unsubstantiated hearsay allegations about Mrs. Watson and her family while withholding your name from the public. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Opposing views have always been welcome here and will continue to be. When they involve aspersions against my own character or reputation I will publish them, even when they are anonymous and entirely without merit -- but that applies only to such casual defamation directed at &lt;i&gt;me&lt;/i&gt;. I will not be a party to such treatment of Sherri Watson, or anybody else, and have no moral or ethical responsibility to do so.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/5757889659258353192'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/5757889659258353192'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1404128188052#c5757889659258353192' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='18' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-bAwUsWSNJqY/Ut1X_S7xqyI/AAAAAAAAKBs/c-w-CbO5t1c/s220/New%2BProfile%2BPic.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 30, 2014 at 5:36 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2427299291818704931</id><published>2014-06-29T07:48:11.338-06:00</published><updated>2014-06-29T07:48:11.338-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Anonymous, by your own admission you do not live i...</title><content type='html'>Anonymous, by your own admission you do not live in Santaquin or Genola, and you have no first-hand knowledge of anything that has transpired between Chad Black and the Watson family.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;At very best your comments would have to be dismissed as malicious gossip, but since you insist on cowering in anonymity your comments can&amp;#39;t even achieve that level of credibility. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I have indulged you this far, but will do so no further. If you have anything more to say about this matter, you&amp;#39;ll have to do so on the record. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/2427299291818704931'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/2427299291818704931'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1404049691338#c2427299291818704931' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='18' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/-bAwUsWSNJqY/Ut1X_S7xqyI/AAAAAAAAKBs/c-w-CbO5t1c/s220/New%2BProfile%2BPic.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 29, 2014 at 7:48 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5578640375771851013</id><published>2014-06-29T01:30:10.909-06:00</published><updated>2014-06-29T01:30:10.909-06:00</updated><title type='text'></title><content type='html'>This comment has been removed by a blog administrator.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/5578640375771851013'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/5578640375771851013'/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name='blogger.contentRemoved' value='true'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-55619199"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 29, 2014 at 1:30 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9039076477161177365</id><published>2014-06-18T15:32:40.303-06:00</published><updated>2014-06-18T15:32:40.303-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I usually try to stay as neutral with my mouth (as...</title><content type='html'>I usually try to stay as neutral with my mouth (as it has a mind of its own at times)until I read and do a bit more research on topics or issues occurring to people, you know so I don&amp;#39;t make an arse out of myself..Writer, wow great use of links to help the process along and you did great keeping my attention.  Sheri Watson~ I don&amp;#39;t know you personally but I can say without a doubt &amp;quot;BRAVO and Kudos&amp;quot; to you and your loved ones for your strength and continued dedication to getting justice for your family and others going through similar injustices at the hands of the few power hungry.  ~My general comment~ I do not think all law enforcement are created the same but I do see that there are an abundance of power hungry, corrupt, sadistic, vile, disgraceful gits out there who hide behind their badges as well as other guises of authority to be true menaces of society.  I applaud those who truly Protect and Serve.  To you fools out there who are guilty of discriminating, harrassing, abusing, threatening, out right stalking or any other crude behavior, what goes around comes around and the people will UNITE to see you pay for your crimes. I hope to be there when it happens.  Former Mayor~ I applaud your efforts,lets hope others follow your example, I am saddened that you feel you have to just &amp;quot;try and put this behind&amp;quot; you, when there is still great need for strong people like you to keep the fight for real justice going.  Take care all and keep the truth out there so it doesn&amp;#39;t disappear into obscurity.  FYI: If you have a comment for me please remember you never know who or rather what age will read it so do try to keep it as clean as possible~unlike*Anonymous* Thanks so much for reading my 2 Cents!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/9039076477161177365'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/9039076477161177365'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1403127160303#c9039076477161177365' title=''/><author><name>Crystle Joy</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12018423277975083941</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh3.googleusercontent.com/--C-_0ozoxpg/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAACE/4NAURvXI7V8/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1105269945"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 18, 2014 at 3:32 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1860870196658151102</id><published>2014-05-22T04:08:22.475-06:00</published><updated>2014-05-22T04:08:22.475-06:00</updated><title type='text'>MY, OH, MY.  What&amp;#39;s that sound I hear?  Could ...</title><content type='html'>MY, OH, MY.  What&amp;#39;s that sound I hear?  Could it be the sour twang of  a taut nerve being struck by the weight of truth?  I&amp;#39;m certain it&amp;#39;s not a tiny violin playing my heart bleeds for you. A bruised ego will warrent no sympathy here. &lt;br /&gt;You can always count on a control freak to chime in when their secrets are revealed. In poker it&amp;#39;s called a tell. They get so wrapped up in acheiving control over others that they forget to control themselves. Another revealing character flaw that&amp;#39;s easy to spot is failing to quit when they&amp;#39;re ahead. They just keep on pushin&amp;#39;.&lt;br /&gt;Looks like that arrest report was more revealing than it&amp;#39;s appearance in print. Nice of you to omit the charge or charges, a kindness that probably wasn&amp;#39;t deserved.&lt;br /&gt;Thank you for sharing your plight Sherri.&lt;br /&gt;It&amp;#39;s good to see there are still people left out there who aren&amp;#39;t afraid to speak out against an officers misuse and abuse of authority. &lt;br /&gt;Sadly, many remain silent, a silence that allows the cyle of abuse to continue eroding the dignity of us all. &lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/1860870196658151102'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3450871995328950411/comments/default/1860870196658151102'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html?showComment=1400753302475#c1860870196658151102' title=''/><author><name>disturbedredhead</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/02605592217805032702</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/04/fleeing-stalker-in-uniform-sherri.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3450871995328950411' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3450871995328950411' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-225234693"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 22, 2014 at 4:08 AM"/></entry></feed>